{"record": {"artifacts": [{"id": "arxiv:2502.08636", "kind": "paper", "locator": "linked URL", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.08636"}, {"id": "gh:XingruiWang/Spatial457", "kind": "repo", "locator": "GitHub repository URL", "url": "https://github.com/XingruiWang/Spatial457"}, {"id": "hf:RyanWW/Spatial457", "kind": "dataset", "locator": "Hugging Face dataset URL", "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/RyanWW/Spatial457"}], "categories": ["多模态", "Multimodal", "推理", "Reasoning", "理解", "Understanding", "3D Spatial Reasoning", "Spatial Intelligence", "物理智能", "Embodied AI", "逻辑推理", "图像理解", "Image Understanding", "空间理解", "Spatial Understanding", "不支持", "Unsupported"], "description": {"en": "Spatial457 systematically introduces four key capabilities—multi-object understanding, 2D and 3D localization, and 3D orientation—across five difficulty levels and seven question types, from simple object recognition to complex 6DoF spatial reasoning tasks.", "zh": "Spatial457 聚焦于空间推理的四项核心能力：多物体理解、二维位置识别、三维位置识别，以及三维朝向判断。这些能力对现实世界中复杂场景的认知和理解至关重要。我们构建了一种层级递进的评估结构，将问题划分为 7 类问题类型，覆盖从基础的单物体识别任务，到我们首次提出的更具挑战性的 6DoF 空间推理任务。整个数据集按 5 个难度等级组织，帮助系统性地评估模型在不同层次空间理解任务中的表现。\n\nSpatial457 不仅提升了空间推理评测的覆盖面和挑战性，也为后续研究提供了统一的基准，有助于推动多模态模型在真实世界空间认知任务中的发展。"}, "documents": [{"document_type": "registry_page", "id": "opencompass_hub:https://hub.opencompass.org.cn/dataset-detail/Spatial457", "source": "opencompass_hub", "source_url": "https://hub.opencompass.org.cn/dataset-detail/Spatial457", "title": "Spatial457"}], "evidence_summary": {"document_count": 1, "model_count": null, "model_count_basis": null}, "key": "opencompass:2092", "languages": [], "modality": "multimodal", "name": "Spatial457", "openness": {"access_gate": "none", "basis": "Row 1: code_public=yes; data_located=found; data_license=permissive_or_sharealike", "code_license": null, "code_license_note": null, "data_license": "Apache-2.0", "data_license_note": null, "data_located": "found", "evidence": [{"evidence_url": "https://huggingface.co/ap